[ti:Visitor song]
[ar:nishal21 and visitors]
[00:05.00]Someone stopped by late on a quiet night
[00:10.00]left a single note and went on their way
[00:15.00]I never got their name until the credits
[00:20.00]now it plays here every single day
[00:25.00]I was painting a picture (@nishal21)
[00:30.00]One note at a time
[00:35.00]from people passing through
[00:40.00]a name beside a line
[00:45.00]and part of it is you
[00:50.00]Leave yours and the song gets one beat longer
